<title>USA: Logicon sets July 17 for shareholder vote.</title>
<headline>Logicon sets July 17 for shareholder vote.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-06-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>Logicon Inc on Monday said it set July 17 as the date for a special meeting of shareholders to consider and vote on the company's proposed merger with Northrop Grumman Corp.</p>
<p>Stockholders of record at the close of business on June 6 are entitled to be notified of the meeting and vote. If the merger is approved at the special meeting, Logicon stockholders will receive .6161 shares of Northrop Grumman common stock for each share of Logicon common stock.</p>
</text>
